"हो । Special thanks goes to:\n"
"{contributors}\n"

msgid "About Nuance Vocalizer for NVDA"
msgstr "नेत्रवाणीका लागि उपलब्ध  Nuance Vocalizer को बारेमा । "

msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to remove your license?\n"
"This can not be reverted."
msgstr ""
"के तपाई आफ्नो इजाजत हटाउने कुराम विश्वस्त हुनु हुन्छ? यसलाई फेरी फर्काउन त सकिदैन है! "

msgid "Automatic &Language Switching Settings"
msgstr "&भाषाको स्वचालित परिवर्तन"

msgid "Choose license file"
msgstr "इजाजत फाइल छान्नु होस् ।"

msgid "Configure which voice is to be used for each language."
msgstr "प्रत्येक भाषामा कुन छाही आवाज चलाउने हो सो को अभियोजन गर्नु होस् ।"

msgid "Distributor: "
msgstr "वितरक: "

msgid "Download More Voices"
msgstr "थप अरू आवाजहरू डाउनलोड गर्नु होस् ।"

msgid "Enter License"
msgstr "ईजाजत प्रविष्टी गर्नु होस् ।"

msgid "Enter your license data for this computer."
msgstr "यो कल्पयन्त्रका लागि उपलभ्ध इजाजत तथ्याङ्क प्रविष्टी गर्नु होस् ।"

msgid "Entering License Data:"
msgstr "इजाजत तथ्याङ्क प्रविष्टी गरिदै ।:"

msgid "Error"
msgstr "त्रुटी"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Error copying license data: {error}"
msgstr "इजाजत तथ्याङ्क उतार्दाको त्रुटी: {error}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Error removing license: {error}"
msgstr "इजाजत हटाउद आएको त्रुटी: {error}"

msgid "License Number: "
msgstr "इजाजत सङ्ख्या: "

msgid ""
"License entered successfully!\n"
"For all changes to take effect NVDA must be restarted.\n"
"Do you want to restart NVDA now?"
msgstr ""
"ईजाजत सफलता पूर्वक प्रवेश भयो!\n"
"सबै परिवर्तनहरूको प्रभाब हेर्नका लागि नेत्रवाणीलाई सुरूवात गर्नु पर्छ ।\n"
" के तपाइ नेत्रवाणी अहिले नै सुरुवात गर्न चाहनु हुन्छ ?"

msgid "License file found, but detailed information is unavailable."
msgstr "इजाजत तथ्याङ्क उपलब्ध छैन ।"

msgid "License removed. Restart NVDA for the change to take effect."
msgstr ""
"इजाजतलाई सफलतापूर्वक हटाइयो । परिवर्तनको प्रभावकारिताको लागि नेत्रवाणीलाई पुनः "
"सुरुवात गर्नु होस् ।"

msgid ""
"License validity is checked by the 32-bit Automotive host. Detailed license "
"errors are not available through the current 64/32-bit bridge."
msgstr ""

msgid "Locale Name:"
msgstr "स्थानीय नाम"

msgid "No Automotive voice resources were found."
msgstr "कुनै आवाज भित्र्याइएको छैन ।"

msgid "No License."
msgstr "ईजाजत छैन"

# Restored for the original Vocalizer Automotive missing-voices behavior.
msgid "No voices installed."
msgstr "कुनै आवाज भित्र्याइएको छैन ।"

msgid "Nuance Vocalizer license files"
msgstr "Nuance Vocalizer इजाजत फाइल"

msgid "Open the vocalizer voices download page."
msgstr "vocalizer आवाज डाउनलोड पृष्टलाई खोल्नु होस् ।"

msgid "Remove License"
msgstr "इजाजत हटाउ"

msgid "Remove License?"
msgstr "इजाजत हटाउ"

msgid "Remove your license from this NVDA copy"
msgstr "यो नेत्रवाणि प्रतिबाट तपाइको इजाजतलाई हटाउनु होस् ।"

msgid "Select a language, and then configure the voice to be used:"
msgstr "आफ्नो भाषा छान्नु होस् र , प्रयोग गरिने आवाजको अनुयोजन गर्नु होस् ।"

msgid "Success!"
msgstr "सफल"

msgid "The license file exists but could not be read."
msgstr ""

msgid "The license file was copied, but its data could not be read."
msgstr ""

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Use your own Vocalizer license file. The selected file will be copied to "
"your NVDA configuration.\n"
"\n"
"The Automotive engine will check the license after NVDA is restarted. Due to "
"limitations of communication between 64-bit NVDA and the 32-bit host, a "
"detailed reason for rejecting the license may not be displayed. If the "
"engine rejects the license, the synthesizer may simply fail to load.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""

msgid "User Identification: "
msgstr "उपभोक्ताको पहिचान: "

msgid "User Name: "
msgstr "उपभोक्ताको नाम: "

msgid "Vocalizer Automatic Language Switching Settings"
msgstr "Vocalizer भाषाको अअनुकूलताको सवचालित परिवर्तन "

msgid "Vocalizer Automotive"
msgstr ""

msgid "Vocalizer Automotive management options"
msgstr ""

msgid "Voice Name:"
msgstr "आवाजको नाम:"

# Restored for the original Vocalizer Automotive missing-voices behavior.
msgid ""
"You have no Vocalizer voices installed.\n"
"You need at least one voice installed to use Vocalizer for NVDA.\n"
"You can download all Vocalizer voices from the product web page.\n"
"Would you want to open the vocalizer for NVDA voices download page now?"
msgstr ""
"तपाइले कुनै पनि Vocalizer आवाजलाई भित्र्याउनु भएको छैन ।nतपाइले नेत्रवाणीका लागि "
"निर्मित Vocalizer मद्धे कुनै एउटा आवाजलाई भित्र्याउनै पर्छ ।\n"
"तपाइले सबै Vocalizer आवाजहरू उत्पादन वेभ पृष्ठबाट डाउनलोड गर्न सक्नु हुनेछ ।\n"
"के तपाइ नेत्रवाणीका लागि निर्मित vocalizer आवाज डाउनलोड पृष्ठ अहिले नै पल्टाउन चाहनु "
"हुन्छ?"
